{
  "id": "c05",
  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "第一次"
  },
  "start": "c05_n0001",
  "nodes": {
    "c05_n0001": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假第六天的傍晚，特蕾西给卢卡发了条消息。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0002"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0002": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "来工坊。有东西给你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0003"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0003": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡到的时候，特蕾西背对着门站在工作台前。听见声音，她转过身，把什么东西藏在身后，藏得不太好，黄铜的一角从手肘边露出来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0004"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0004": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "闭眼。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0005"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0005": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0006"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0006": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡照做。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0007"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0007": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "伸手。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0008"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0008": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他伸出手。一个沉甸甸的东西落进掌心，凉的，有齿轮的棱角。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0009"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0009": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "睁眼。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0010"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0010": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "是一个机械音乐盒。黄铜外壳，大小刚好能捧住，外壳上嵌着几个外露的齿轮，上满发条的地方做成了小小的摇柄。他认得那上面每一个零件的来路——十六齿的齿轮，是那天补货买到的；那圈铜边，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0011"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0011": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "是她工坊里常备的料。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0012"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0012": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我做的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0013"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0013": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，声音很轻，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0014"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0014": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "做了好久。之前不告诉你，就是在做这个。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0015"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0015": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她伸手，替他转了几下摇柄。齿轮咬合，音乐从盒子里流出来，是一段很慢的调子。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0016"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0016": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "送你的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0017"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0017": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0018"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0018": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "定情信物，行吗。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0019"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0019": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡捧着音乐盒，好半天没说话。他张了张嘴，只挤出一个字："
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0020"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0020": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "行。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0021"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0021": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "音乐转着。工坊里安静下来，只有发条和音符的响动。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0022"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0022": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西抬头看他，眼睛里的紫色光跳了跳。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0023"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0023": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0024"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0024": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0025"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0025": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0026"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0026": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我准备好了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0027"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0027": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没有立刻动。他先把音乐盒小心地放在旁边的工作台上，让它继续转着，然后看向她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0028"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0028": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你确定？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0029"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0029": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "确定。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0030"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0030": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，声音不大，但很稳，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0031"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0031": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我昨天就想好了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0032"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0032": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她开始脱自己的衣服。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0033"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0033": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "先是护目镜——从额上摘下来，放在工作台上，跟音乐盒并排。然后是项圈，那颗紫宝石吊坠在灯下一晃。束身上衣的扣子一颗颗解开，露出里面那套黑蕾丝内衣。腰间的浅紫薄纱解下来，垂在沙发上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0034"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0034": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "长筒袜褪下去，破洞的地方露出膝盖。短靴踢掉。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0035"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0035": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "最后是那套黑蕾丝内衣。她背过手，解了搭扣，内衣滑下来，再弯下腰，把最后一件也褪了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0036"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0036": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她坐回旧沙发上，光着，仰头看他。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0037"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0037": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "到你了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0038"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0038": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0039"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0039": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡脱得比她慢，手指有点抖。等他脱完，特蕾西已经并着腿坐在那儿了，耳尖红着，眼睛却不躲。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0040"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0040": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "过来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0041"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0041": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0042"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0042": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两人在旧沙发上贴到一起。特蕾西勾住他的脖子，主动亲上去。她的皮肤很烫，胸口贴着他的，乳肉被挤得变了形。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0043"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0043": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的手覆上她的胸，揉。乳肉在他掌心里陷下去，又弹回来，乳尖硬起来，颜色是淡淡的粉。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0044"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0044": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0045"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0045": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0046"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0046": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，仰起脖子，把胸往他手里送。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0047"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0047": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下面……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0048"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0048": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0049"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0049": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "也摸摸。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0050"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0050": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡的手往下，摸到她腿间。那里已经湿了，小穴微微分开，湿漉漉地泛着水光。他伸出手指，探进去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0051"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0051": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西整个人一缩，又松开，抓着他的手腕。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0052"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0052": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "够了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0053"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0053": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0054"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0054": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，够了，进来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0055"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0055": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你会……疼的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0056"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0056": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡说，嗓子发紧。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0057"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0057": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不会。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0058"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0058": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0059"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0059": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你信我。我查过了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0060"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0060": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她抓着他的胳膊，自己把腿张得更开，脚跟踩在沙发边上，一点点引导他。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0061"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0061": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你慢点进。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0062"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0062": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0063"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0063": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我会跟你说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0064"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0064": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡扶着自己，抵上去。顶端刚碰到，特蕾西就抖了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0065"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0065": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "胀。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0066"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0066": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0067"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0067": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "没事，继续。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0068"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0068": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他慢慢往里进。很慢，慢得两个人都能感觉到彼此的温度。特蕾西的穴口被撑开，小穴紧紧地裹上来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0069"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0069": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "胀……好胀。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0070"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0070": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她仰着头，话断断续续，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0071"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0071": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "撑……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0072"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0072": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "疼吗？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0073"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0073": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡停下来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0074"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0074": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不疼。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0075"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0075": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，眼睛有点湿，但没哭，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0076"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0076": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是胀。你……继续，别停。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0077"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0077": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他继续。一点一点，直到整个都埋进去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0078"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0078": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两个人同时喘出声。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0079"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0079": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "全部……进去了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0080"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0080": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，声音很小，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0081"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0081": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，你在里面了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0082"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0082": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡没动。他撑在她身上，怕她疼，动作轻得不敢使劲。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0083"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0083": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你动。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0084"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0084": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0085"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0085": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我没事。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0086"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0086": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他开始动。很慢，很轻，一下一下。沙发随着动作发出细微的响。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0087"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0087": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西的腿缠上他的腰，脚跟压在他后腰上。她的手抓着他的背，指甲陷进去一点，又松开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0088"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0088": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "深……好深。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0089"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0089": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0090"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0090": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……卢卡……好深……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0091"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0091": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他加快了一点。肉棒在她湿滑的穴里进出，带出黏黏的水声。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0092"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0092": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咕啾……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0093"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0093": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西的胸随着他的动作晃起来，乳肉颤着，乳尖挺得更高。她伸手，抓着他的手按在自己胸上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0094"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0094": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "揉……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0095"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0095": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0096"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0096": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "揉我。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0097"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0097": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡揉着她的胸，下身没停。特蕾西仰起头，短金发凌乱地铺在沙发靠垫上，眼睛半闭着，嘴里的声音碎得不成句子。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0098"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0098": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "哈……啊……卢卡……好舒服……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0099"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0099": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你舒服吗？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0100"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0100": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡喘着问。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0101"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0101": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "舒服……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0102"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0102": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她抓着他的肩，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0103"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0103": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "很舒服……你……再深一点……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0104"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0104": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他往深里顶了一下。特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0105"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0105": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咿"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0106"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0106": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，两条腿夹紧了他的腰，小穴猛地一缩。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0107"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0107": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "要……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0108"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0108": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，眼睛湿湿地看他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0109"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0109": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，我要……去了……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0110"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0110": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "唔……要去了……卢卡……咿嗯……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0111"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0111": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她整个人绷起来，腿夹紧，小穴一下下地收缩，绞着他。过了几秒，又慢慢软下来，瘫在沙发上，胸口剧烈地起伏。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0112"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0112": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "高潮之后，特蕾西没有躲开，反而伸出胳膊，把他搂进怀里，让他的脸贴在她汗湿的胸口。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0113"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0113": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0114"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0114": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她轻声喊。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0115"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0115": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0116"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0116": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你还没……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0117"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0117": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她顿了顿，小声说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0118"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0118": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你还没好。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0119"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0119": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡埋在她颈窝里，喘着气。他没说话，只又动了几下，然后整个人一僵，抱紧了她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0120"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0120": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "两个人抱在一起，谁都没动。音乐盒还在旁边转着，发条的声音混着两人的喘息。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0121"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0121": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "过了好一会儿，特蕾西先开口。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0122"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0122": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好奇怪。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0123"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0123": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，声音软下来，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0124"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0124": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "原来做完了是这种感觉。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0125"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0125": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "什么感觉？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0126"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0126": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "说不上来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0127"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0127": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她贴着他的脸，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0128"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0128": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是……想一直抱着你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0129"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0129": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她收紧手臂，把他抱得更实了些。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0130"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0130": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次，我还想。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0131"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0131": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，声音很小，但很清楚，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0132"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0132": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次我还想跟你做。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0133"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c05_n0133": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡笑了，没说话，只是更紧地回抱住她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0134"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0134": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "温存了一会儿，特蕾西松开他，翻身坐起来，光着脚踩到地上。她走到工作台前，拿起那个音乐盒，发条已经转完了。她重新上满，音乐又响起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0135"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0135": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次，我们听着这个做。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0136"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c05_n0136": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她回头看他，耳尖红红的，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c05",
        "nodeId": "c05_n0137"
      }
    },
    "c05_n0137": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "好不好。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c06",
        "nodeId": "c06_n0001"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    }
  }
}
